# Catavan: own name and identity, apart from an installed Kdenlive.
# - Application name, About dialog (version 0.1.0, Kdenlive as a component, unofficial fork notice), interface strings
#   naming the application ("Catavan must be restarted"), in all translations.
# - Internal name catavan: catavanrc config, data in share/catavan and ~/.local/share/catavan, catavan.mo translations
#   (sources stay po/<lang>/kdenlive.po), catavan and catavan_render executables, catavanlock, own knsrc files.
# - App ID com.hexoby.Catavan (CATAVAN_APP_ID in CMakeLists.txt, also in notifyrc, .desktop and metainfo).
# - Own art (icons, logo, splash; images live only in src/), "Made by KDE" removed from the splash.
# - Kdenlive update reminder off. Kept from Kdenlive: the .kdenlive format, format names, online docs.
